    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d31">

                <pb facs="0137" n="17" sameAs="frus:frus1931v02/pg17"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">821.6363/1140: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Colombia</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic">Caffery</hi>) <hi
                        rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1931-06-10T15:00:00-05:00">June 10, 1931—3
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 5:35 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>78. President Olaya tells me he forwarded by air mail Friday<anchor n="20"
                        xml:id="d31-f1"/> copy of draft of proposed oil bill regulations to Rublee
                    for any comment he may care to make before they are issued.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Caffery</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
